WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:04.830
<b>Helck and Vermilio continue their journey
towards the demons' base.</b>

00:05.760 --> 00:09.620
<b>However, it was already
under human attack.</b>

00:10.630 --> 00:12.300
<b>To shatter Helck's resolve,</b>

00:12.560 --> 00:14.330
<b>and to attack Vermilio,</b>

00:15.360 --> 00:18.940
<b>Rafaed summons a single winged soldier.</b>

01:51.000 --> 01:56.030
<b>To a Future With Hope</b>

02:11.080 --> 02:12.250
<b>Helck's comrade...</b>

02:25.210 --> 02:28.700
<b>Did he assume I'm supporting Helck
and went all out with his attack?</b>

02:29.550 --> 02:30.550
<b>Bring it on.</b>

02:39.400 --> 02:40.110
<b>Helck!</b>

02:43.240 --> 02:44.290
<b>I'm fine here!</b>

02:44.710 --> 02:45.830
<b>Don't worry!</b>

02:47.660 --> 02:48.660
<b>So you can...</b>

03:00.630 --> 03:01.630
<b>It's okay.</b>

03:06.020 --> 03:07.150
<b>I'm sure Helck will</b>

03:07.830 --> 03:08.650
<b>be okay.</b>

03:18.310 --> 03:22.250
<b>It's you who knows not one
thing about him, demon.</b>

03:24.850 --> 03:27.940
<b>Since the very beginning,
he has never been too fond of fighting.</b>

03:28.550 --> 03:30.190
<b>Even with all his strength,</b>

03:30.200 --> 03:31.860
<b>he never used it for himself,</b>

03:32.090 --> 03:34.670
<b>always fighting for other peoples' sakes.</b>

03:38.300 --> 03:41.460
<b>Helck is a kind man who
always thinks of his comrades.</b>

03:42.260 --> 03:43.640
<b>He puts on a brave facade,</b>

03:43.990 --> 03:45.870
<b>in spite of always suffering.</b>

03:47.310 --> 03:49.350
<b>In no way is he alright.</b>

04:18.910 --> 04:19.910
<b>Helck...</b>

04:48.620 --> 04:49.620
<b>Demon...</b>

04:50.030 --> 04:51.310
<b>Can you feel it?</b>

04:51.660 --> 04:54.320
<b>This is Helck's despair and anguish.</b>

04:55.110 --> 04:57.220
<b>Humans are weak creatures.</b>

04:57.780 --> 04:59.570
<b>They cannot overcome such sorrow.</b>

05:00.020 --> 05:01.650
<b>Not even Helck himself.</b>

05:03.130 --> 05:07.480
<b>Just who can bear to kill an
irreplaceable person with their own hands?</b>

05:09.020 --> 05:10.450
<b>Do you recognise me,</b>

05:10.660 --> 05:11.350
<b>Alicia?</b>

05:24.220 --> 05:26.380
<b>We meet again.</b>

05:27.160 --> 05:27.940
<b>I see.</b>

05:28.600 --> 05:29.600
<b>That girl is...</b>

05:30.310 --> 05:31.310
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

05:31.870 --> 05:34.010
<b>Because of my own selfishness,</b>

05:34.540 --> 05:36.470
<b>you were forced to suffer.</b>

05:38.250 --> 05:39.080
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

05:39.590 --> 05:40.590
<b>I'm so sorry.</b>

05:41.640 --> 05:43.100
<b>I'll put an end to it.</b>

05:44.100 --> 05:46.060
<b>I promise I'll end it.</b>

05:47.100 --> 05:47.890
<b>His comrade...</b>

05:51.240 --> 05:52.240
<b>His friend...</b>

05:59.730 --> 06:00.690
<b>Lady Vermilio...</b>

06:01.660 --> 06:02.850
<b>With his own hands...</b>

06:03.610 --> 06:04.610
<b>His comrades...</b>

06:06.210 --> 06:07.170
<b>His friends...</b>

06:08.240 --> 06:09.240
<b>He'll kill them?</b>

06:13.590 --> 06:14.590
<b>I see.</b>

06:15.390 --> 06:18.720
<b>I finally understand this feeling
that has always been with me.</b>

06:19.450 --> 06:21.090
<b>How much pain it causes,</b>

06:21.610 --> 06:23.050
<b>as well as sorrow.</b>

06:24.070 --> 06:24.800
<b>Damn it.</b>

06:25.560 --> 06:29.010
<b>This feeling wasn't me being anxious
about Helck or anything like that.</b>

06:29.900 --> 06:32.860
<b>As a fellow member of the
human race, I must end it.</b>

06:34.400 --> 06:35.400
<b>This is Helck we're talking about!</b>

06:35.870 --> 06:37.020
<b>That Helck!</b>

06:37.830 --> 06:39.230
<b>Always putting his own needs behind</b>

06:39.750 --> 06:41.150
<b>and thinking of others first.</b>

06:42.620 --> 06:43.280
<b>Kind,</b>

06:43.700 --> 06:44.320
<b>strong,</b>

06:44.700 --> 06:45.800
<b>and considerate of his comrades.</b>

06:46.180 --> 06:48.430
<b>Never knowing when to give up,
more so than anyone else!</b>

06:49.040 --> 06:50.290
<b>He didn't want to do it.</b>

06:50.620 --> 06:51.860
<b>He was agonising about it.</b>

06:52.340 --> 06:54.730
<b>Why couldn't I understand
his feelings better?</b>

06:55.240 --> 06:56.810
<b>Why did I not notice?</b>

07:03.140 --> 07:04.380
<b>I shall not let you interfere.</b>

07:06.610 --> 07:08.630
<b>The reason he entered
the Demon King Tournament</b>

07:09.270 --> 07:12.420
<b>was not to entrust the Hero Killer
to Azudra, was it?</b>

07:13.030 --> 07:15.000
<b>He never wanted to destroy humans, did he?</b>

07:16.980 --> 07:17.620
<b>Helck,</b>

07:18.200 --> 07:19.280
<b>you really are...</b>

07:20.240 --> 07:21.570
<b>Really are our...</b>

07:26.050 --> 07:27.640
<b>Stop meddling with Helck!</b>

07:31.690 --> 07:33.860
<b>If you truly are his friend,</b>

07:34.170 --> 07:35.460
<b>let him have his peace.</b>

07:37.880 --> 07:39.540
<b>Here, Helck shall lose himself.</b>

07:39.900 --> 07:41.670
<b>He shall begin
wrecking havoc as a monster.</b>

07:42.100 --> 07:42.620
<b>However,</b>

07:42.900 --> 07:45.360
<b>that's how he shall finally
be freed of his misery.</b>

07:46.100 --> 07:48.800
<b>This is the only way to save him.</b>

07:49.120 --> 07:50.430
<b>Like I've already said,</b>

07:50.940 --> 07:51.940
<b>Helck is strong!</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:53.220
<b>He won't go berserk!</b>

07:53.470 --> 07:55.090
<b>He'll finish what he started without fail!</b>

07:55.680 --> 07:57.690
<b>Even still, I shall not allow this!</b>

08:07.710 --> 08:08.640
<b>So this is...</b>

08:09.450 --> 08:10.780
<b>the Hero Killer?</b>

08:12.040 --> 08:12.830
<b>I see,</b>

08:13.190 --> 08:14.030
<b>Helck.</b>

08:14.530 --> 08:16.540
<b>So you entrusted it to that demon?</b>

08:20.540 --> 08:22.590
<b>Helck's strength is diminishing.</b>

08:23.330 --> 08:24.230
<b>Could it be?</b>

08:24.620 --> 08:26.430
<b>Will he actually surpass it?</b>

08:33.080 --> 08:34.100
<b>Once this ends,</b>

08:34.790 --> 08:35.850
<b>come to the Empire.</b>

08:36.610 --> 08:37.350
<b>Don't worry.</b>

08:37.810 --> 08:39.490
<b>Everyone will welcome you.</b>

08:40.880 --> 08:41.480
<b>No!</b>

08:41.760 --> 08:42.670
<b>That's not it!</b>

08:44.860 --> 08:45.750
<b>Helck!</b>

08:46.290 --> 08:47.150
<b>Stop!</b>

08:53.600 --> 08:54.310
<b>Back then,</b>

08:55.000 --> 08:56.600
<b>the words I should have said were...</b>

09:07.990 --> 09:09.350
<b>What I should have said was...</b>

09:11.320 --> 09:13.180
<b>Let's save the humans.</b>

09:15.570 --> 09:17.040
<b>Aren't they your treasured comrades?</b>

09:17.670 --> 09:19.120
<b>Aren't they the friends you cherish?</b>

09:20.290 --> 09:22.400
<b>Aren't they those special people
you can't replace?</b>

09:23.340 --> 09:24.800
<b>If they are, you can't give up!</b>

09:26.290 --> 09:28.450
<b>Sure, the situation seems dire.</b>

09:29.480 --> 09:30.450
<b>Still, weren't you</b>

09:30.840 --> 09:33.170
<b>able to have conversations with Edil?</b>

09:33.970 --> 09:36.500
<b>Didn't you hold Alicia in your arms?</b>

09:37.340 --> 09:38.350
<b>They're not dead yet.</b>

09:38.890 --> 09:40.580
<b>Your comrades aren't dead yet!</b>

09:41.520 --> 09:42.750
<b>All hope is not lost!</b>

09:43.820 --> 09:45.140
<b>You saw it too.</b>

09:45.710 --> 09:46.940
<b>This vast world.</b>

09:47.660 --> 09:50.230
<b>Including the outrageous things
that happened to your comrades.</b>

09:50.780 --> 09:51.820
<b>This world is</b>

09:52.050 --> 09:53.600
<b>teeming with incredible possibilities!</b>

09:54.150 --> 09:54.740
<b>I'm sure...</b>

09:55.400 --> 09:57.170
<b>I'm sure there's a way to save them!</b>

09:57.640 --> 09:58.680
<b>Don't give up!</b>

09:58.910 --> 09:59.930
<b>Don't lose heart!</b>

10:00.840 --> 10:01.520
<b>Rebel.</b>

10:02.000 --> 10:02.640
<b>Fight.</b>

10:03.190 --> 10:04.590
<b>Save the humans!</b>

10:05.110 --> 10:07.000
<b>The people you love!</b>

10:12.620 --> 10:13.160
<b>Anne...</b>

10:14.120 --> 10:14.780
<b>I'm...</b>

10:16.130 --> 10:16.910
<b>It's okay.</b>

10:21.940 --> 10:23.270
<b>You're not alone.</b>

10:28.020 --> 10:30.220
<b>This time, I'll accompany you.</b>

10:46.630 --> 10:47.630
<b>How refreshing.</b>

10:48.190 --> 10:50.490
<b>Prepare yourselves, humans!</b>

10:51.720 --> 10:53.750
<b>I will save you.</b>

10:54.460 --> 10:55.190
<b>I'm back in full spirits!</b>

10:59.670 --> 11:01.220
<b>This is not anyone else's will.</b>

11:01.800 --> 11:04.860
<b>After much groaning and aching,
I have chosen this path.</b>

11:05.910 --> 11:08.790
<b>No one can overrule this will of mine!</b>

11:09.630 --> 11:11.260
<b>All my hesitation is gone!</b>

11:11.640 --> 11:12.670
<b>I, Vermilio,</b>

11:13.000 --> 11:15.700
<b>will save the humans without fail!</b>

11:18.270 --> 11:19.440
<b>I can see everything clearly.</b>

11:20.590 --> 11:21.300
<b>That's right.</b>

11:21.750 --> 11:23.740
<b>I never fully understood it.</b>

11:24.480 --> 11:25.870
<b>And now I've finally figured it out.</b>

11:27.450 --> 11:28.700
<b>The right choice...</b>

11:31.240 --> 11:31.760
<b>Perhaps,</b>

11:32.180 --> 11:34.530
<b>it's the wrong choice as a Heavenly King.</b>

11:36.340 --> 11:38.970
<b>Even so, Helck is already my comrade.</b>

11:39.490 --> 11:40.490
<b>I can't abandon him.</b>

11:42.350 --> 11:44.030
<b>The pain of killing beloved friends...</b>

11:44.790 --> 11:45.840
<b>The pain of losing them...</b>

11:46.790 --> 11:48.030
<b>Once all of it is over,</b>

11:48.760 --> 11:50.790
<b>even if we were to
welcome Helck with open arms...</b>

11:52.110 --> 11:53.770
<b>He won't be able to smile.</b>

11:55.300 --> 11:57.480
<b>It won't be a smile from the heart.</b>

11:59.620 --> 12:00.680
<b>And so I have decided.</b>

12:01.400 --> 12:02.210
<b>The humans,</b>

12:02.610 --> 12:03.610
<b>Helck, I'll save them!</b>

12:04.650 --> 12:06.170
<b>So what if the future is hopeless?</b>

12:06.840 --> 12:08.520
<b>I refuse to accept such a future!</b>

12:10.430 --> 12:13.290
<b>Even if Helck accepts it, I simply cannot!</b>

12:13.740 --> 12:14.710
<b>I don't want to!</b>

12:15.660 --> 12:16.660
<b>I'll struggle.</b>

12:17.300 --> 12:19.230
<b>I don't know if this is
the right choice or not,</b>

12:19.900 --> 12:21.640
<b>I will definitely...</b>

12:22.440 --> 12:25.470
<b>A mutilated body and a shattered identity</b>

12:25.680 --> 12:27.420
<b>cannot be returned to
what they used to be.</b>

12:28.400 --> 12:31.600
<b>Speak not of such frivolous dreams,</b>

12:32.100 --> 12:32.950
<b>demon.</b>

12:33.960 --> 12:34.960
<b>Right back at you.</b>

12:35.190 --> 12:37.930
<b>Don't go around spouting about
despair like you know everything!</b>

12:38.570 --> 12:41.010
<b>There's no proof they can't
go back to being what they were.</b>

12:41.860 --> 12:43.330
<b>Even if it seems impossible,</b>

12:43.720 --> 12:45.380
<b>there's a chance it might work if we try.</b>

12:46.040 --> 12:47.280
<b>I myself will see the outcome.</b>

12:47.740 --> 12:48.860
<b>You don't have a say in this!</b>

12:49.830 --> 12:52.220
<b>The Demon King's castle has
fallen due that attack earlier.</b>

12:54.490 --> 12:57.770
<b>Moreover, Azudra of
the Heavenly Kings is dead.</b>

12:59.690 --> 13:01.700
<b>Our army is one made of immortals,</b>

13:02.080 --> 13:04.110
<b>the vigour of our advances
cannot be stopped.</b>

13:04.870 --> 13:08.980
<b>As you continue to struggle,
you only cause more damage.</b>

13:11.460 --> 13:13.290
<b>Can you endure it?</b>

13:14.090 --> 13:16.500
<b>Stop talking about
saving humans or whatever that i...</b>

13:16.500 --> 13:18.180
<b>What do you think you're saying?</b>

13:19.550 --> 13:20.840
<b>Azudra, dead?</b>

13:21.610 --> 13:23.660
<b>That would be
an incredible feat if it were true.</b>

13:24.230 --> 13:25.230
<b>Let me make it clear.</b>

13:25.330 --> 13:26.980
<b>The man is pretty tenacious.</b>

13:28.900 --> 13:31.100
<b>Azudra is dead, he was killed...</b>

13:31.690 --> 13:35.110
<b>Just how many dozens of times
do you think I've heard these words?</b>

13:36.700 --> 13:38.710
<b>The first time I heard of Azudra's death,</b>

13:39.080 --> 13:40.700
<b>was back when I was still young.</b>

13:41.520 --> 13:43.600
<b>Being told he had been
reckless and lost his life,</b>

13:44.460 --> 13:46.520
<b>I still remember how depressed I was.</b>

13:48.310 --> 13:50.510
<b>However, he hadn't died!</b>

13:50.540 --> 13:51.560
<b>He was alive!</b>

13:52.220 --> 13:53.970
<b>It's always been that way ever since!</b>

13:54.730 --> 13:57.320
<b>He takes in a sharp breath,
even after his heart stops!</b>

13:57.910 --> 14:00.490
<b>He comes back with a bang,
even after falling into the deepest pit.</b>

14:02.350 --> 14:04.760
<b>He doesn't have
a strong body like Helck's.</b>

14:05.260 --> 14:07.350
<b>He doesn't have powerful
regeneration powers either.</b>

14:07.830 --> 14:08.440
<b>Still,</b>

14:08.850 --> 14:11.820
<b>he somehow always makes it out alive
at the very last minute.</b>

14:12.140 --> 14:14.810
<b>That's why, whether his heart was pierced,</b>

14:15.180 --> 14:16.850
<b>or his head was cut off...</b>

14:17.310 --> 14:19.450
<b>Unless I see it with my own two eyes,</b>

14:19.470 --> 14:21.990
<b>I will never believe that Azudra is dead!</b>

14:22.350 --> 14:23.740
<b>I will say it again.</b>

14:23.980 --> 14:25.170
<b>He is tenacious!</b>

14:29.170 --> 14:30.720
<b>- Ow!
- Oh, you're up.</b>

14:31.440 --> 14:32.970
<b>Lord Azudra!</b>

14:33.750 --> 14:35.110
<b>That's right, Azudra!</b>

14:35.480 --> 14:37.020
<b>Let's try talking to him first.</b>

14:38.430 --> 14:40.370
<b>He has lived a lot longer than I have.</b>

14:40.860 --> 14:43.370
<b>I'm sure he'll know something
that could serve as a hint.</b>

14:44.140 --> 14:45.830
<b>- Lord Azudra!
- Lord Azudra!</b>

14:46.350 --> 14:47.010
<b>Guys...</b>

14:47.010 --> 14:47.840
<b>It's alright.</b>

14:48.200 --> 14:49.900
<b>Azudra adores humans.</b>

14:50.380 --> 14:51.940
<b>I'm sure he'll help us with his wisdom.</b>

14:52.140 --> 14:53.180
<b>Lord Azudra!</b>

14:53.670 --> 14:54.610
<b>Thank goodness!</b>

14:55.580 --> 14:56.820
<b>Unfold your arms.</b>

14:57.490 --> 14:59.430
<b>Now, don't make that tense face.</b>

14:59.930 --> 15:01.290
<b>Azudra is fine.</b>

15:01.670 --> 15:02.820
<b>He's crazy tenacious.</b>

15:04.020 --> 15:05.740
<b>I don't know how, but I'm sure.</b>

15:13.900 --> 15:15.480
<b>Lord Azudra is...</b>

15:16.260 --> 15:17.450
<b>He's losing consciousness</b>

15:17.460 --> 15:18.620
<b>Medics!</b>

15:18.740 --> 15:21.330
<b>Lord Azudra is laughing
as he's coughing up blood.</b>

15:22.090 --> 15:23.180
<b>Medics...</b>

15:26.950 --> 15:27.950
<b>I see.</b>

15:28.230 --> 15:29.340
<b>From what she just said,</b>

15:29.830 --> 15:31.910
<b>that demon is probably...</b>

15:32.380 --> 15:33.910
<b>I'll save the humans.</b>

15:35.240 --> 15:37.210
<b>Even if Helck were to tell me to stop,</b>

15:37.990 --> 15:39.560
<b>my resolve shall not be shaken.</b>

15:40.510 --> 15:42.160
<b>I see. In that case...</b>

16:07.460 --> 16:08.350
<b>No way.</b>

16:08.540 --> 16:11.000
<b>Do you honestly believe you can save them?</b>

16:27.380 --> 16:29.190
<b>Struggle to your heart's content.</b>

16:30.740 --> 16:33.410
<b>Eventually, you'll realise
that it was all for naught.</b>

16:47.190 --> 16:48.190
<b>I'm sorry</b>

16:48.960 --> 16:51.520
<b>for behaving like I was
trampling all over your resolve.</b>

16:52.380 --> 16:55.040
<b>Your words truly do stir up my heart.</b>

16:56.170 --> 16:57.170
<b>Earlier, you...</b>

16:57.660 --> 17:00.350
<b>You told me to come to the empire
once everything was over.</b>

17:01.360 --> 17:03.410
<b>Just how much did those words save me...</b>

17:04.600 --> 17:06.860
<b>Thanks to that,
my determination to destroy humans</b>

17:07.310 --> 17:09.960
<b>was able to become much stronger.</b>

17:10.620 --> 17:11.920
<b>But I really am no good...</b>

17:13.000 --> 17:14.950
<b>Because of those words you said earlier,</b>

17:15.580 --> 17:18.420
<b>these feelings I've suppressed
for so long came rushing back.</b>

17:21.970 --> 17:23.070
<b>I want to save humans.</b>

17:24.220 --> 17:25.410
<b>I want to save everyone.</b>

17:26.460 --> 17:26.950
<b>Yeah,</b>

17:27.660 --> 17:28.360
<b>I know.</b>

17:31.550 --> 17:32.560
<b>We'll save them,</b>

17:33.010 --> 17:33.780
<b>for sure.</b>

17:46.400 --> 17:48.610
<b>Now, let's finally have our fight today.</b>

17:50.700 --> 17:52.780
<b>I'll end you without making you suffer.</b>

18:03.810 --> 18:04.810
<b>Shin's Castle?</b>

18:05.440 --> 18:05.980
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:06.390 --> 18:08.930
<b>It's a demon castle
far further south of Tooru's Castle.</b>

18:09.650 --> 18:11.850
<b>We might be able to get in contact
with Azudra from there.</b>

18:13.100 --> 18:16.520
<b>Kushiki, inform all the others
scattered around in the area about this.</b>

18:17.080 --> 18:17.680
<b>Ma'am.</b>

18:18.050 --> 18:19.730
<b>Um, I have something I'd like to ask.</b>

18:19.960 --> 18:20.560
<b>What is it?</b>

18:20.880 --> 18:21.880
<b>Will Mr. Bird over there</b>

18:22.330 --> 18:24.250
<b>be okay with the land's poison?</b>

18:26.620 --> 18:29.520
<b>Hey you! I'm not a bird!</b>

18:30.240 --> 18:31.030
<b>Right.</b>

18:31.310 --> 18:33.100
<b>I completely forgot about that.</b>

18:33.160 --> 18:34.140
<b>Annie!</b>

18:35.000 --> 18:37.590
<b>Then, I'll head to Shin's Castle first</b>

18:37.780 --> 18:40.020
<b>and prepare a carriage
with a simple barrier.</b>

18:40.360 --> 18:42.700
<b>I'll come along!
 It's dangerous to travel alone.</b>

18:43.360 --> 18:45.590
<b>Yeah. I'm counting on you, everyone.</b>

18:45.920 --> 18:46.950
<b>- Ma'am.
- Yup!</b>

18:51.270 --> 18:54.140
<b>Three people from
the search party have returned.</b>

18:54.640 --> 18:56.600
<b>What? What do you mean?</b>

18:57.860 --> 18:59.050
<b>Allow me to report.</b>

19:02.690 --> 19:05.140
<b>We've found Lady Vermilio safe and sound!</b>

19:06.570 --> 19:07.570
<b>Good work!</b>

19:07.720 --> 19:10.710
<b>As we expected, she continued her travels
with Helck and his companions.</b>

19:11.240 --> 19:15.770
<b>She seemed unhurt and is believed to be
heading to the human castle to destroy it.</b>

19:16.250 --> 19:17.540
<b>Is she at the base then?</b>

19:18.050 --> 19:20.020
<b>No, she's heading towards Shin Castle.</b>

19:21.380 --> 19:23.280
<b>Rufuu and Harpy from
the search party have also</b>

19:23.300 --> 19:25.380
<b>brought back new information with them.</b>

19:26.110 --> 19:28.060
<b>It seems that
the southern base was discovered</b>

19:28.410 --> 19:30.010
<b>and subsequently destroyed by humans.</b>

19:31.020 --> 19:32.190
<b>Containing more information</b>

19:32.820 --> 19:34.270
<b>is this letter from Lady Vermilio.</b>

19:43.830 --> 19:44.720
<b>I see.</b>

19:46.540 --> 19:47.670
<b>She wants to save them, huh?</b>

19:48.670 --> 19:49.600
<b>The humans...</b>

19:51.640 --> 19:54.200
<b>So there's a demon castle
in the south too.</b>

19:54.880 --> 19:58.730
<b>Distance-wise, this is closer to
the human castle than Tooru's Castle,</b>

19:59.140 --> 20:02.490
<b>but the terrain is rugged
and teeming with demons.</b>

20:06.130 --> 20:07.460
<b>Miss Anne!</b>

20:07.870 --> 20:09.480
<b>Helck!</b>

20:12.680 --> 20:13.460
<b>Ah, okay.</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:15.380
<b>The humans showed up at Shin Castle too...</b>

20:15.650 --> 20:16.100
<b>Yes.</b>

20:16.430 --> 20:18.430
<b>So I joined the battle too!</b>

20:18.840 --> 20:23.010
<b>We earned a splendid victory,
all thanks to Lord Azudra's strategy!</b>

20:28.630 --> 20:29.660
<b>How is Azudra?</b>

20:30.230 --> 20:32.100
<b>I heard that he died, but...</b>

20:32.490 --> 20:36.020
<b>He's as battered and healthy as always!</b>

20:37.090 --> 20:39.860
<b>Just like I told you. The guy's tenacious!</b>

20:40.060 --> 20:41.760
<b>There's no use worrying about him.</b>

20:45.500 --> 20:46.560
<b>Hello!</b>

20:46.710 --> 20:47.780
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

20:47.940 --> 20:49.070
<b>I'm Roccoco!</b>

20:51.250 --> 20:53.990
<b>Okay! Now that all's settled,
let's hurry up and leave.</b>

20:55.090 --> 20:57.140
<b>Hello! I'm Piwi!</b>

20:58.660 --> 21:00.130
<b>Let's go. To Shin Castle.</b>

21:00.950 --> 21:01.460
<b>Yeah.</b>
